{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-brings-smoothness-resolution","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:brings-smoothness-resolution","kind":"proposition","title":"Smoothness of the Bring's surface and intrinsic resolution of projection singularities","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-color-bundles"],"tags":["brings-surface","smooth","resolution","branch-point","color"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.BringsSurface.brings_smoothness_resolution","text":"brings-smoothness-resolution.md","leanSource":"brings-smoothness-resolution.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:brings-smoothness-resolution\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{S}</code> be the Bring's surface (<a href=\"#def:brings-surface\" data-at=\"brings-surface/brings-surface-qou\">Bring's surface</a>) with color projection <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\pi \\colon \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathbb{P}^1(\\mathbb{C})</code>.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Smoothness.</strong> The three power-sum constraints are transverse in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{P}^4</code>, so <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{S}</code> is smooth.</li>\n<li><strong>Intrinsic resolution.</strong> At each branch point <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">z = z_c</code> where two color sheets <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">x_i, x_j</code> collide, the local coordinate <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\delta = x_i - x_j</code> satisfies <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">z - z_c \\sim \\delta^2</code>; the blow-up's exceptional divisor is already embedded in the color coordinates, so no external resolution is required.</li>\n</ol>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/brings-smoothness-resolution.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"8.7.2","page":"b/prop-brings-smoothness-resolution","qa":{"counts":{"pass":99,"fail":0,"warn":1,"na":18,"unknown":0,"stale":93},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.BringsSurface.BringsSurfaceRoot.brings_smoothness_resolution","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/brings-smoothness-resolution.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
